flowchart TB
  PY[Optimized Python: sphere_shadow / flat_pow] --> NATIVE[Proposed native adapter and CPU control]
  NATIVE --> BRIDGE[Processor bridge: implementation pending]
  BRIDGE -->|operand writes: 64 bits + 3-bit address| REGS[8 x 64-bit operand registers]
  BRIDGE -->|8-bit opcode + valid/ready| FSM[GEOM FSM: IDLE / ISSUE / WAIT / RESP]
  REGS --> MUX[Operand muxes]
  TMP[10 x 64-bit temporary registers] --> MUX
  FSM --> MUX
  MUX --> ADD[HardFloat add/sub]
  MUX --> MUL[HardFloat multiplier]
  MUX --> ITER[HardFloat iterative div/sqrt]
  ADD --> OUT[Result mux + finite/status check]
  MUL --> OUT
  ITER -->|completion handshake| OUT
  OUT --> TMP
  OUT -->|64-bit result + 4-bit status; held valid/ready| BRIDGE
